            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FizzyTongs6469"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Our recipe also calls for a 3 oz(or 6 oz if doubled) pkg of dry, cherry jello and mini marshmallows. It’s a favorite at our big family gatherings.",
